[center][size=6][b]AutoStation[/b][/size]
[size=4]Your stations, fed from your chests.[/size]
[size=3][color=#ffcc00]BETA 1.0.3 - back up your save before using it.[/color][/size][/center]

[size=4][b]What it does[/b][/size]
Queue a recipe by hand [b]once[/b] on a grinder/refinery, smelter, kiln, spinning wheel (and more). AutoStation then:
[list]
[*][b]Refills the queue[/b] with the same recipe. The game itself takes the ingredients from nearby chests, exactly like normal crafting - nothing is spawned.
[*][b]Stores finished items straight into a chest[/b] that already holds that item - never through your backpack. If no chest holds it (or it is full), they stay in the station.
[*][b]Protects your backpack[/b]: the game spends backpack ingredients first, so AutoStation gives the same amount back from a nearby chest - the chest pays, your backpack stays the same. When the chests run low, the station waits.
[*][b]Stops when you want[/b]: cancel an item from the station's queue by hand, or press [b]Ctrl+F5[/b].
[/list]
Supported: Refinery/Grinder, Smelter, Kiln, Spinning Wheel, Cooking Station, Glue Factory, Paint Mixer, Drying Rack, Grill, Mash Bowl.

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Grounded 2 (Steam)
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/grounded2/mods/259]UE4SS for Grounded 2[/url]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [b]UE4SS for Grounded 2[/b] into [i]...\steamapps\common\Grounded2\Augusta\Binaries\Win64\[/i]
[*]Extract the [b]AutoStation[/b] folder into [i]...\Grounded2\Augusta\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods\[/i] (enabled.txt included)
[*][b]Back up[/b] [i]%USERPROFILE%\Saved Games\Grounded2[/i]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Usage[/b][/size]
Stand at a station with chests nearby and queue a recipe by hand. Keep playing nearby - every few seconds the station is refilled and finished items are stored.
[list]
[*][b]Ctrl+F5[/b] - toggle tracking of the nearest station
[*][b]Ctrl+F11[/b] - list tracked stations in the log
[/list]

[size=4][b]Limitations (beta)[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Works only while you are near the station (40 m by default) - the game only uses chests close to the player for crafting.
[*]Tracking resets when the game restarts: queue once by hand again, or press Ctrl+F5 at the station.
[*]Multiplayer: host only.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Configuration[/b][/size]
Top of [i]AutoStation\Scripts\main.lua[/i]: check interval, chest radius (15 m), active radius (40 m), refills per tick, verbose log.

[size=4][b]Troubleshooting[/b][/size]
[i]...\Win64\ue4ss\UE4SS.log[/i], lines starting with [b][AutoStation][/b]. Post them in the Bugs tab or on GitHub.

[size=4][b]Source code[/b][/size]
[url=https://github.com/kamibiel/autostation]github.com/kamibiel/autostation[/url] (MIT)

